<section id="features">
  <div class="section-tag">What's Inside</div>
  <h2>Your Complete Command Center</h2>
  <p class="sec-sub">Everything a transitioning service member needs in one place. No more hunting across 15 different government websites.</p>
  <div class="feat-grid">
    <div class="feat-card"><span class="feat-ic">📊</span><div class="feat-title">Overview Dashboard</div><div class="feat-desc">Personalized bento dashboard with countdown to separation, task progress, priority actions, and your mission snapshot — built from your profile.</div></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><span class="feat-ic">✅</span><div class="feat-title">44-Task Checklist</div><div class="feat-desc">Every task you need across 6 categories — Admin, VA, Finance, Housing, Career, and Family — with urgency ratings and detailed action guidance.</div></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><span class="feat-ic">🏥</span><div class="feat-title">VA Claim Strategy</div><div class="feat-desc">BDD filing timeline, conditions tracker, C&P exam guidance, VSO recommendations, and TRICARE transition comparison. Don't leave a single rating point on the table.</div></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><span class="feat-ic">📄</span><div class="feat-title">Live Resume Builder</div><div class="feat-desc">Split-pane live preview with MOS/Rate/AFSC translator for 40+ military codes across all branches. Converts military language to civilian-ready resumes. Print-to-PDF in one click.</div></div>
