    <div class="feat-card"><span class="feat-ic">📨</span><div class="feat-title">5 Email Templates</div><div class="feat-desc">Auto-filled professional templates: introduction, post-interview thank you, veteran network outreach, federal job cover letter, and VA claim follow-up.</div></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><span class="feat-ic">🗺️</span><div class="feat-title">3-Plan Career Tracker</div><div class="feat-desc">Build Alpha, Bravo, and Charlie career plans with execution steps, pros/cons, and notes. Mission planning applied to your career transition.</div></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><span class="feat-ic">👨‍👩‍👧</span><div class="feat-title">Family Resources</div><div class="feat-desc">Spouse employment resources (MySECO, MyCAA, HOH), children's school transition checklist, and DEERS/dependent benefit change guidance.</div></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><span class="feat-ic">🎓</span><div class="feat-title">Certification Roadmap</div><div class="feat-desc">60+ MOS/Rate/AFSC paths across all 6 branches — enlisted and officer. Personalized 18-month plan showing exactly which cert to earn, what it costs, and how your branch pays for it via COOL.</div></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><span class="feat-ic">🔗</span><div class="feat-title">58 Curated Resources</div><div class="feat-desc">Fully vetted links across 7 categories — VA claims, COOL programs, career, finance, mental health, legal/VSOs, housing, and branch-specific transition programs for all six branches.</div></div>
  </div>
