<!-- FAQ -->
<section>
  <div class="section-tag">Questions</div>
  <h2>Frequently Asked</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Is this really a one-time purchase? No subscription?<span class="faq-arr">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes — completely. You pay $39 once and have lifetime access. No monthly fees, no renewal, no upsell. The app runs entirely on your device and your data never leaves it.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Does it work offline?<span class="faq-arr">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes. TransitionCommand is a Progressive Web App (PWA) that works without internet once installed. Install it on any device — phone, tablet, laptop — and use it anywhere, including on post or deployed.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Who can see my data?<span class="faq-arr">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Nobody but you. All data is stored in your browser's local storage on your device. KIBU Global Ventures LLC has zero access to your personal information, VA claim details, or any other data you enter.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What branches and separation types does it cover?<span class="faq-arr">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">All six branches — Army, Navy, Air Force, Marines, Coast Guard, and Space Force. All separation types — retirement (20+ years), ETS/end of enlistment, officer REFRAD, medical separation, RIF, and hardship discharge.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How do I get my license key after purchase?<span class="faq-arr">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Your license key is emailed to you immediately after payment confirms through Stripe. Enter it in the app to unlock full access. If you don't receive it within 5 minutes, check your spam folder or contact support@kibuglobal.com.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Can I use it on multiple devices?<span class="faq-arr">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes — one license key works on all your personal devices. Use it on your phone and your laptop simultaneously.</div></div>
